  "body": "The JavaScript specification is changing to make a HostEnqueuePromiseJob\nhook to be implemented by embedders, see https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/1597.\n\nThis PR allows HTML to avoid its willful violation, and delete an explanation of the\nmotivation for this violation.\n\n(Deleted the PR template as this change is editorial.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4722/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2019, 6:45 AM UTC (e8bae1b)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4722/39dd204...e8bae1b/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2019, 6:45 AM UTC (e8bae1b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4722/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2019, 6:45 AM UTC (e8bae1b)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4722/39dd204...e8bae1b/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2019, 6:45 AM UTC (e8bae1b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4722/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2019, 6:45 AM UTC (e8bae1b)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4722/39dd204...e8bae1b/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2019, 6:45 AM UTC (e8bae1b)\">diff</a> )",
